  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Accelerating the Implementation of REDD+ in Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objectives of the Trust Fund are to assist the improved development of REDD+ strategies, policies, investment programs and projects in African countries as part of their low-emission development strategies and to accelerate and help bridge key financing gaps for the implementation of REDD+ and forest-smart development in African countries.</narrative>
  </description>
